{"seq":3,"slug":"lossless-vs-lossy","title":"无损与有损压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/foundations/lossless-vs-lossy","wordCount":1865,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"无损与有损压缩\">无损与有损压缩</h1><p>把一份合同 PDF 压缩后再解压，少一个字都不行；把一张度假照片压缩后再打开，肉眼看不出区别就够了。这两种需求背后是压缩世界最根本的一条分水岭：要不要完全可逆。这条线决定了一个算法受不受<a href=\"entropy-redundancy\">熵</a>的硬约束，也决定了它能压到多狠。这一篇把这条线讲清楚，并引入描述「有损到什么程度」的率失真理论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-可逆性这条分水岭\">核心概念：可逆性这条分水岭</h2><p>无损压缩要求解压输出与原始输入逐比特相同。它只能剔除真正多余的表达，因此被<a href=\"compression-basics\">香农信源编码定理</a>死死压在熵这条线之上——文本、可执行文件、源代码、数据库、医学影像原片，凡是「错一位就出问题」的数据都必须无损。</p>\n<p>有损压缩则允许解压输出与原始输入不同，只要差异落在可接受范围内。它的杀手锏是重新定义「什么算信息」：如果某些数据人感知不到或不在乎，那它对接收者而言根本不是信息，丢掉不算损失。正因为绕开了熵的约束，有损压缩能达到无损望尘莫及的比特率——一张照片用 JPEG 压到原始的 1/10 仍可用，而无损的 PNG 通常只能压到 1/2 左右。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始数据] --&gt; B{可接受不完全还原?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否 必须逐比特一致| C[无损压缩]&#10;    B --&gt;|是 可丢感知冗余| D[有损压缩]&#10;    C --&gt; E[受熵约束&lt;br/&gt;压缩比有限]&#10;    D --&gt; F[受率失真约束&lt;br/&gt;压缩比可极高]&#10;    C --&gt; G[文本/代码/归档]&#10;    D --&gt; H[图像/音频/视频]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始数据] --&gt; B{可接受不完全还原?}\n    B --&gt;|否 必须逐比特一致| C[无损压缩]\n    B --&gt;|是 可丢感知冗余| D[有损压缩]\n    C --&gt; E[受熵约束&lt;br/&gt;压缩比有限]\n    D --&gt; F[受率失真约束&lt;br/&gt;压缩比可极高]\n    C --&gt; G[文本/代码/归档]\n    D --&gt; H[图像/音频/视频]</pre><h2 id=\"谁该用哪种-决策的几条硬规则\">谁该用哪种：决策的几条硬规则</h2><p>选无损还是有损，几乎完全由数据的语义和用途决定，而非由你想压多小决定。下表给出工程中的判断锚点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>一般选择</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本、源码、日志</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>任何字符错误都不可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可执行文件、归档</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>一位错即损坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然照片</td>\n<td>有损（AVIF/JPEG）</td>\n<td>人眼容忍细节损失，比特率收益巨大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>录音、音乐</td>\n<td>有损（AAC/Opus）</td>\n<td>听觉掩蔽使大量信息可丢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏幕截图、线稿、图标</td>\n<td>无损（PNG/WebP无损）</td>\n<td>锐利边缘有损会糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>医学影像、底片存档</td>\n<td>无损或视觉无损</td>\n<td>法规与诊断要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常见误区是对线稿、UI 截图用 JPEG——这类图边缘锐利、色块平整，恰恰是有损压缩最不擅长的，会产生明显的振铃伪影。具体的图像格式取舍见<a href=\"../specialized/image-audio-compression\">图像与音频有损压缩</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"率失真理论-丢多少换多少\">率失真理论：丢多少换多少</h2><p>有损压缩需要一套理论来回答「丢掉多少信息能省多少比特」，这就是香农的率失真理论。它引入失真度量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>（如均方误差）来量化「差多远」，并定义率失真函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：在容许失真不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的前提下，所需的最小比特率。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></munder><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(D) = \\min_{p(\\hat{x}\\mid x):\\, \\mathbb{E}[d(x,\\hat{x})]\\le D} I(X;\\hat{X})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9128em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb mtight\">E</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)]</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(X;\\hat{X})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是原始与重建之间的互信息。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是一条单调递减曲线：容许的失真越大，需要的比特越少。无损压缩对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(0)=H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>，正好退化回熵——可见无损只是有损在「零失真」处的特例。率失真曲线给了有损压缩它自己的理论极限，正如熵之于无损。理解这条曲线还能纠正一个常见误解：把质量参数调到极高并不能无限逼近原图而不增大体积，曲线在低失真端会急剧变陡，最后那一点点失真的消除往往要付出成倍的比特代价。这也是为什么「视觉无损」常比「数学无损」划算得多——前者落在曲线还算平缓的区段，后者却要爬完最陡的那一截。工程上选定一个工作点，本质就是在这条曲线上找一个失真可接受、比特又划算的拐点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"衡量失真-从-mse-到感知指标\">衡量失真：从 MSE 到感知指标</h2><p>率失真里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 怎么算，直接决定了优化方向是否对得上人的真实感受。最简单的失真度量是均方误差及由它导出的 PSNR（峰值信噪比），计算便宜、数学好用，但和人眼判断常常不一致——两张 PSNR 相同的图，观感可能差很远。</p>\n<p>于是工程界发展出更贴近感知的指标：SSIM（结构相似度）关注结构而非逐像素差异；视频领域广泛使用的 VMAF 用机器学习融合多个感知特征，是 Netflix 等流媒体调码率的事实标准；音频则有 PEAQ、POLQA 等心理声学度量。现代有损编码器越来越直接对感知指标做优化，而不是盲目最小化 MSE，这背后正是<a href=\"../specialized/image-audio-compression\">图像与音频有损压缩</a>里心理视觉与心理声学模型的用武之地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视觉无损与近无损-模糊地带\">视觉无损与近无损：模糊地带</h2><p>无损与有损之间还有一条灰色地带值得专门一提：视觉无损（或近无损）。它在技术上是有损的，但失真控制在人类察觉阈值以下——例如把量化误差压到肉眼分辨不出。许多归档场景和高质量网页图片用的就是这种策略：拿到接近无损的观感，却只付出有损级别的体积。JPEG XL、AVIF 都提供这类近无损模式，是<a href=\"../specialized/compression-tradeoffs\">压缩选型</a>里一个常被忽略却很实用的中间档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个常被误解的边界-无损也压不过熵\">一个常被误解的边界：无损也压不过熵</h2><p>值得澄清一个普遍的误会：很多人以为「无损只是压得少一点的有损」，仿佛只要愿意，无损也能逼近有损的比特率。事实并非如此。无损被<a href=\"compression-basics\">香农信源编码定理</a>死死锁在熵这条线上，再聪明的无损算法也越不过去。有损之所以能把照片压到无损的十分之一，不是因为它的编码更高明，而是因为它先把问题改小了——通过量化丢弃了大量信息，让待编码的数据本身熵就低得多，剩下的无损编码部分依然遵守同一条定理。</p>\n<p>这个区分很重要，因为它界定了优化的方向。当你觉得「这份数据怎么压都压不够小」时，先问自己处在哪一边：如果必须无损，那熵就是你的天花板，唯一的出路是建更准的模型把熵估得更低；如果可以有损，那真正的杠杆在量化策略和感知模型，而非熵编码器。把这两条路混为一谈，是压缩工程里最常见的方向性错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分水岭是可逆性：无损逐比特一致、受熵约束；有损允许差异、受率失真约束。</li>\n<li>有损的本质是重新定义信息——丢掉感知不到的部分，从而突破熵的下界。</li>\n<li>选型由数据语义决定：文本/代码/归档必须无损，照片/音频/视频通常有损，锐利图形别用 JPEG。</li>\n<li>率失真函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是有损压缩的理论极限，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时退化为熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(0)=H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>，无损是有损的特例。</li>\n<li>失真度量从 MSE/PSNR 走向 SSIM、VMAF 等感知指标，现代编码器直接对感知优化。</li>\n<li>视觉无损是技术有损、观感无损的实用中间档，常用于归档与高质量网页图片。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无损与有损压缩","id":"无损与有损压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：可逆性这条分水岭","id":"核心概念-可逆性这条分水岭"},{"level":2,"text":"谁该用哪种：决策的几条硬规则","id":"谁该用哪种-决策的几条硬规则"},{"level":2,"text":"率失真理论：丢多少换多少","id":"率失真理论-丢多少换多少"},{"level":2,"text":"衡量失真：从 MSE 到感知指标","id":"衡量失真-从-mse-到感知指标"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉无损与近无损：模糊地带","id":"视觉无损与近无损-模糊地带"},{"level":2,"text":"一个常被误解的边界：无损也压不过熵","id":"一个常被误解的边界-无损也压不过熵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"熵与冗余","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/foundations/entropy-redundancy"},"next":{"title":"霍夫曼编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding/huffman-coding"}}